{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00860","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南二首 二 · 僧贯休","name":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碛中有阴兵，战马时惊蹶。\n轻猛李陵心，摧残苏武节。\n黄金锁子甲，风吹色如铁。\n十载不封侯，茫茫向谁说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}